{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 81,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "81:1",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:2",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And when the stars fall, dispersing,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:3",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And when the mountains are removed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:4",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And when full-term she-camels are neglected",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:5",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And when the wild beasts are gathered",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:6",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "And when the seas are filled with flame",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:7",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And when the souls are paired",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:8",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:9",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "For what sin she was killed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:10",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And when the pages are spread [i.e., made public]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:11",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "And when the sky is stripped away",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:12",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And when Hellfire is set ablaze",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:13",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "And when Paradise is brought near,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:14",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:15",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "So I swear by the retreating stars -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:16",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Those that run [their courses] and disappear [i.e., set]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:17",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "And by the night as it closes in",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:18",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "And by the dawn when it breathes [i.e., stirs]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:19",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger [i.e., Gabriel]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:20",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:21",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:22",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "And your companion [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ) ] is not [at all] mad.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:23",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "And he has already seen him [i.e., Gabriel] in the clear horizon.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:24",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "And he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:25",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "And it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:26",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "So where are you going?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:27",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "It is not except a reminder to the worlds",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:28",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "For whoever wills among you to take a right course.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "81:29",
      "surahNumber": 81,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And you do not will except that Allāh wills - Lord of the worlds.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
